    <string name="screensaver_system_explain_steps">Google TV doesn\'t list other apps\' screensavers in its settings: it\'s switched on once from a computer. Press OK for the steps. Without a computer, “Start screensaver” shows it whenever you want.</string>
    <string name="screensaver_system_fire_tv">From Fire OS 8.1 on, Fire TV only allows its own screensavers, so Sofascreen is started from here.</string>
    <string name="screensaver_system_fire_tv_old">To start on its own on this Fire OS it needs a computer: the steps are on Sofadrop\'s GitHub page. Otherwise, it\'s started from here.</string>
    <string name="screensaver_system_explain_path">In Android\'s settings, go to Device Preferences → Screen saver and choose Sofascreen. The names can change with the TV\'s brand.</string>
